{"id":"vod_sn_35657","vodId":"35657","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"竹刀少女","name_cn":"竹刀少女","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0c7479c4d7ef81cbe2e06545c50037b6.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在室江高中，身为剑道部的顾问，石田虎侍（小西克幸 配音）每一天都过着浑水摸鱼的懒散日子，剑道这项本该令人热血沸腾的运动在他看来，不过是一群小孩子的小打小闹而已。一个契机的到来改变了石田的生活，为了赢得赌注中的一年份免费寿司，石田决定打起精神，为了赢得剑道部的大赛而奋发努力。　　想要重整旗鼓，就必须敞开大门招贤纳才。个头矮小却充满了正义感的川添珠姫（广桥凉 配音）；性格开朗奔放，对剑道运动十分热衷的千叶纪梨乃（丰口惠美 配音）；看似不良少女，实则千金大小姐的宫崎都（桑岛法子 配音）；个性有些莽撞的幽灵社员桑原鞘子（小岛幸子 配音），在和这些少女一同努力的过程中，石田对剑道这项运动也渐渐的产生了感情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mu4WHtdbyL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H06FKyFV171/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ETaZjaDqwh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N8mxxPh3U91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QxSLq8ZZ6P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H8q9A8rkqG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hcGuR8MZf01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5gRgmer0B41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nXaZDH6PUw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WYne6pdzCx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mjCsEpHCAr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WHjWNrnMPU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BBYvMPWAtd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zDMMmh3qPE1/video/index.m3u